# #144 special cues: every Illidan special form shows its Warcraft spell (Illidan has no #148 passive).
# Illidan a against Illidan b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero illidan
# Mana Burn: its orb hits a standing b.
60 a tap X 2
62 a capture
76 a capture
# Air Fel Rush toward b, Chaos Strike from the air on its frame 17.
200 a tap B 8
210 a stick 1 0
210 a tap X 2
211 a stick 0 0
212 a capture
216 a capture
226 a tap A 2
228 a capture
# Both dash in, about 75 apart.
300 b stick -1 0
302 b stick 0 0
310 a stick 1 0
312 a stick 0 0
# Flame Crash: jump, down special in the air, its landing burst.
380 a tap B 6
390 a stick 0 -1
390 a tap X 2
391 a stick 0 0
392 a capture
394 a capture
402 a capture
# A rush, then Vengeful Retreat (special on its frame 17).
470 a stick 1 0
470 a tap X 2
471 a stick 0 0
472 a capture
476 a capture
486 a tap X 2
488 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# A rush left toward b, then Chaos Strike on the ground (attack on its frame 17).
600 a stick -1 0
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
602 a capture
606 a capture
616 a tap A 2
618 a capture
# Immolation on the ground, its whole burn.
700 a stick 0 -1
700 a tap X 2
701 a stick 0 0
702 a capture
704 a capture
# Turn left, jump, Wing Ascent, glide on its 17th frame, wing slash.
800 a stick -0.5 0
804 a stick 0 0
840 a tap B 6
847 a stick 0 1
847 a tap X 2
848 a stick 0 0
849 a capture
851 a capture
863 a tap B 2
865 a capture
871 a tap A 2
